WEBVTT

00:00:42.731 --> 00:00:43.771
[This drama is a work of fiction.]

00:00:43.771 --> 00:00:44.816
[Any resemblance to real persons,
places, or events is coincidental.]

00:00:44.816 --> 00:00:45.841
[Scenes with child actors and animals
were filmed safely]

00:00:45.841 --> 00:00:47.402
[under professional supervision.]

00:00:47.402 --> 00:00:50.981
[One year later]

00:00:52.320 --> 00:00:55.209
<i>My part in this story is over.</i>

00:01:06.355 --> 00:01:08.890
<i>Deep down, I knew all along.</i>

00:01:14.023 --> 00:01:18.691
<i>From the start, I was just a side character,
following someone else's script,</i>

00:01:25.605 --> 00:01:29.327
<i>caught in a web spun by the people on top.</i>

00:02:04.938 --> 00:02:07.490
<i>Inside that hell,</i>

00:02:11.105 --> 00:02:13.913
<i>the worthless dream I carried</i>

00:02:14.736 --> 00:02:17.750
<i>didn't stand a chance.</i>

00:02:20.064 --> 00:02:21.370
Pull yourself together.

00:02:21.370 --> 00:02:24.006
<i>Even so, in that hell...</i>

00:02:26.023 --> 00:02:27.044
Pull yourself together!

00:02:27.044 --> 00:02:31.055
<i>Should my leaving light
even the faintest flame,</i>

00:02:31.923 --> 00:02:33.564
<i>out of this miserable destiny...</i>

00:02:33.564 --> 00:02:36.382
For God's sake, pull yourself together.

00:02:36.382 --> 00:02:39.897
<i>that alone would've made it all worthwhile.</i>

00:02:42.314 --> 00:02:44.277
No.

00:02:47.272 --> 00:02:49.198
No.

00:02:53.731 --> 00:02:55.663
Please...

00:03:21.439 --> 00:03:22.897
Sang Ah.

00:03:22.897 --> 00:03:24.859
Are you okay?

00:03:57.451 --> 00:03:59.011
Simply sharing the same stage

00:03:59.011 --> 00:04:01.125
[Final Episode]
was exciting and such a privilege.

00:04:01.125 --> 00:04:03.431
Performing with her in particular,

00:04:03.431 --> 00:04:05.267
I've received so many wonderful sparks
of motivation...

00:04:05.267 --> 00:04:08.856
[Avoid mentions of the late Hwang Jeong Won]
My question is for actress Chu Sang Ah.

00:04:08.856 --> 00:04:11.188
While shooting, one of the film's clips

00:04:11.188 --> 00:04:14.442
got confused for actual leaked material,

00:04:14.442 --> 00:04:17.064
and it became a whole thing.

00:04:17.064 --> 00:04:20.105
What was going through your mind at the time?

00:04:20.105 --> 00:04:21.324
Not easy, honestly.

00:04:21.324 --> 00:04:22.627
[Four Seasons]

00:04:22.627 --> 00:04:26.997
I comforted myself by thinking it just proved
how convincing my performance was.

00:04:26.997 --> 00:04:29.530
On top of that,
it gave the movie free publicity,

00:04:29.530 --> 00:04:31.355
so we tried tracking down who was behind it.

00:04:31.355 --> 00:04:35.005
[Actress Chu Sang Ah]
The studio tried to give that person a bonus,

00:04:35.005 --> 00:04:39.127
but they must've gotten nervous
because nobody ever owned up.

00:04:39.127 --> 00:04:41.027
Appreciate the response.

00:04:41.027 --> 00:04:44.097
Would it be okay to squeeze in one more?

00:04:44.097 --> 00:04:47.303
Of course, seems like there's more.
Please, go on.

00:04:47.303 --> 00:04:50.228
Much appreciated. Just one more thing.

00:04:50.228 --> 00:04:54.733
That intimate scene between the two women
was absolutely stunning...

00:04:57.105 --> 00:04:58.322
Hell of a job out there.

00:04:58.322 --> 00:05:00.268
Loved the movie.

00:05:00.268 --> 00:05:03.374
And getting into the festival, that's huge.

00:05:04.564 --> 00:05:05.994
Thank you.

00:05:05.994 --> 00:05:07.837
Couldn't have done it without you.

00:05:09.355 --> 00:05:11.625
By the way,

00:05:11.625 --> 00:05:13.369
I read you booked your next project.

00:05:13.369 --> 00:05:15.261
That's great news.

00:05:16.755 --> 00:05:19.223
You seem to be doing well too.

00:05:21.314 --> 00:05:24.554
Son Guk Won's campaign brought me on board.

00:05:24.554 --> 00:05:28.315
With the presidential race coming up fast,
things are only going to pile up from here.

00:05:30.644 --> 00:05:33.696
Nice. I'll be cheering you on.

00:05:35.439 --> 00:05:38.576
We should get moving now.

00:05:42.522 --> 00:05:44.915
I appreciate you showing up.

00:05:45.647 --> 00:05:47.793
Look after yourself.

00:05:50.326 --> 00:05:52.256
Sang Ah.

00:06:03.188 --> 00:06:05.939
I've got something

00:06:05.939 --> 00:06:08.147
to run by you.

00:06:18.626 --> 00:06:21.028
<i>Let's get to your Monday morning headlines.</i>

00:06:21.028 --> 00:06:24.689
<i>With the heated showdown
between Doyak Party's Son Guk Won</i>

00:06:24.689 --> 00:06:26.825
<i>and Changjo Party's Gu Hong Seo still raging,</i>

00:06:26.825 --> 00:06:28.785
<i>the latest polls</i>

00:06:28.785 --> 00:06:32.630
<i>put Candidate Son
at the top in approval ratings.</i>

00:06:36.376 --> 00:06:37.919
[The assemblyman has confirmed it]

00:06:37.919 --> 00:06:38.933
[Campaign Manager Lee Chan Yong]

00:06:48.179 --> 00:06:51.106
[22nd Presidential Election Debate]

00:07:01.285 --> 00:07:03.285
Reconsider this, sir.

00:07:03.285 --> 00:07:06.698
Voters today are levelheaded and sharp.

00:07:06.698 --> 00:07:10.225
Some tearjerker bit about a vintage watch
isn't fooling anyone.

00:07:10.225 --> 00:07:12.746
Changjo doesn't have proof regardless,

00:07:12.746 --> 00:07:14.718
so no matter what they hurl at me,

00:07:14.718 --> 00:07:17.205
brush it off as groundless smear tactics.

00:07:17.205 --> 00:07:19.677
If I may, sir, just a second.

00:07:22.714 --> 00:07:24.174
Sure, that buys us time today,

00:07:24.174 --> 00:07:26.713
but it won't turn the tide in our direction.

00:07:26.713 --> 00:07:28.023
Winning this election

00:07:28.023 --> 00:07:30.805
takes a narrative that hits people in the gut.

00:07:30.805 --> 00:07:32.647
Once we can predict

00:07:32.647 --> 00:07:34.517
what Changjo's throwing at us, like today,

00:07:34.517 --> 00:07:36.439
dropping our counter
at precisely the right beat

00:07:36.439 --> 00:07:38.438
makes your integrity

00:07:38.438 --> 00:07:40.948
and patriotism land even harder.

00:07:43.573 --> 00:07:45.993
Fair enough.

00:07:45.993 --> 00:07:49.199
Nobody knows their playbook better than you,

00:07:49.199 --> 00:07:51.584
considering you were one of them.

00:07:56.540 --> 00:07:58.465
Sir.

00:08:02.230 --> 00:08:04.548
Tonight will be the spark

00:08:04.548 --> 00:08:06.807
that sets off our upward trajectory from here.

00:08:28.071 --> 00:08:30.480
Your loyalty, I can't count on.

00:08:30.480 --> 00:08:32.708
But that mind of yours, I believe in.

00:08:34.369 --> 00:08:36.309
I appreciate that.

00:08:48.467 --> 00:08:51.727
Leave the timing to me.

00:08:56.891 --> 00:08:58.393
[22nd Presidential Election Debate]

00:08:58.393 --> 00:09:01.355
Out of every candidate in this race,

00:09:01.355 --> 00:09:04.483
not one has less moral credibility
than Candidate Son.

00:09:04.483 --> 00:09:06.981
Between the Daeyang Fund slush accounts,

00:09:06.981 --> 00:09:11.483
corporate kickbacks, and abuse of power,

00:09:11.483 --> 00:09:13.482
that's only what we already know about.

00:09:13.482 --> 00:09:16.202
Imagine what else will turn up
once we start digging.

00:09:16.202 --> 00:09:18.555
Is this really the person we'd trust

00:09:18.555 --> 00:09:20.248
to carry this nation on his shoulders?

00:09:20.248 --> 00:09:23.122
Those recordings from the general election

00:09:23.122 --> 00:09:25.629
were confirmed as forgeries.
Didn't we already settle that?

00:09:25.629 --> 00:09:27.881
What makes you keep pushing falsehoods

00:09:27.881 --> 00:09:30.027
with nothing to back them up?

00:09:30.027 --> 00:09:32.810
You plan on dodging this
all the way to the finish?

00:09:34.513 --> 00:09:36.059
[Transcript of Daeyang Fund]
What we've gathered alone is

00:09:36.059 --> 00:09:38.016
more than enough for a warrant.

00:09:38.016 --> 00:09:40.184
There isn't a doubt in my mind

00:09:40.184 --> 00:09:43.771
that you're lying to our faces.

00:09:43.771 --> 00:09:44.856
Should I be mistaken,

00:09:44.856 --> 00:09:47.400
I'll resign from this race

00:09:47.400 --> 00:09:51.829
and surrender everything I own.

00:09:52.585 --> 00:09:56.417
So what are you willing to stake?

00:10:10.105 --> 00:10:12.564
My grandfather carried this watch

00:10:12.564 --> 00:10:16.163
through the independence movement in the 1930s.

00:10:16.163 --> 00:10:19.690
It's been our family's
most sacred possession ever since.

00:10:27.037 --> 00:10:29.575
Can you see the blood on it?

00:10:30.464 --> 00:10:32.439
Should I

00:10:32.439 --> 00:10:34.632
really be the symbol of corruption,

00:10:34.632 --> 00:10:38.314
some fossil dragging Korean politics backwards,

00:10:38.314 --> 00:10:41.993
then I'll walk away from this election today.

00:10:41.993 --> 00:10:43.897
- Yet.
- Yet

00:10:43.897 --> 00:10:46.397
- Every single day, I hold this watch
- every single day,

00:10:46.397 --> 00:10:48.093
- and remind myself that
- I hold this watch

00:10:48.093 --> 00:10:49.772
- and remind myself that...
- our forebears built this country

00:10:49.772 --> 00:10:51.154
through blood and sacrifice.

00:10:51.154 --> 00:10:53.272
our forebears built this country
through blood and sacrifice.

00:10:53.272 --> 00:10:54.801
Every fiber of my being

00:10:54.801 --> 00:10:56.768
- has gone...
- Every fiber of my being

00:10:56.768 --> 00:10:58.555
- into serving this nation.
- has gone into serving this nation.

00:10:58.555 --> 00:11:00.515
But

00:11:00.515 --> 00:11:03.172
if baseless attacks

00:11:03.172 --> 00:11:07.404
and character assassination are your game,
be my guest.

00:11:08.172 --> 00:11:11.617
Let the citizens of this nation
decide what's real.

00:11:15.822 --> 00:11:18.123
In that spirit,

00:11:18.856 --> 00:11:21.064
I'm staking this seat,

00:11:21.064 --> 00:11:23.731
[22nd Presidential Election Debate]
every last thing I own,

00:11:23.731 --> 00:11:25.419
along with...

00:11:25.419 --> 00:11:29.591
a century of my family's devotion

00:11:29.591 --> 00:11:31.720
to this country.

00:11:36.578 --> 00:11:38.230
Well then, Candidate Gu,

00:11:38.230 --> 00:11:40.687
prepared to step down?

00:11:42.105 --> 00:11:43.600
Wait.

00:11:43.600 --> 00:11:44.726
Just a moment.

00:11:44.726 --> 00:11:47.061
All nine minutes of Candidate Gu Hong Seo's

00:11:47.061 --> 00:11:49.116
initiative segment have been exhausted.

00:11:49.116 --> 00:11:50.523
Candidate Son Guk Won,

00:11:50.523 --> 00:11:52.908
the floor is yours for your initiative debate.

00:11:58.656 --> 00:12:01.188
[TV debate heats up over allegations]
Thank you.

00:12:01.188 --> 00:12:04.046
That was incredible, sir.

00:12:04.046 --> 00:12:05.054
Congratulations.

00:12:05.054 --> 00:12:07.798
Congratulations, sir.

00:12:12.170 --> 00:12:16.007
The watch moment peaked at over 40% viewership.

00:12:16.007 --> 00:12:19.984
And the whole thing buried
the ethics scandal completely.

00:12:19.984 --> 00:12:22.347
I figured it was old-school,

00:12:22.347 --> 00:12:25.384
but the classics never fail.

00:12:25.384 --> 00:12:28.193
Born strategist, born showman.

00:12:50.083 --> 00:12:51.376
Director,

00:12:51.376 --> 00:12:55.230
tonight went perfectly.
Why are we having this conversation again?

00:12:55.230 --> 00:12:58.439
<i>If I rush the insurance reform play,</i>

00:12:58.439 --> 00:13:01.511
I'm just loading the gun for Gu Hong Seo.

00:13:01.511 --> 00:13:03.731
And that gossip floating
around the trading floors,

00:13:03.731 --> 00:13:05.307
that I'll hand you

00:13:05.307 --> 00:13:09.355
WR Life shares once I'm sworn in,

00:13:09.355 --> 00:13:11.920
you don't think the Changjo Party planted that?

00:13:11.920 --> 00:13:14.823
Look.

00:13:19.235 --> 00:13:21.997
Hey, get it together!

00:13:28.455 --> 00:13:30.276
Sir.

00:13:30.276 --> 00:13:33.292
<i>You seem to have a short memory
about everything I did</i>

00:13:33.292 --> 00:13:37.004
to build you up and carry you here.

00:13:37.004 --> 00:13:40.897
Where you go from here is still in my hands.

00:13:40.897 --> 00:13:43.977
Don't forget that.

00:13:45.013 --> 00:13:48.068
One wrong turn from me,

00:13:48.068 --> 00:13:52.103
<i>and you're off the edge. It's that simple.</i>

00:13:52.103 --> 00:13:55.728
Chairman Kwon could go any day now,

00:13:55.728 --> 00:13:57.689
so quit stalling

00:13:57.689 --> 00:14:00.904
and get the inheritance law amendment lined up

00:14:00.904 --> 00:14:03.991
before you even sit down in that chair.

00:14:03.991 --> 00:14:05.791
We clear?

00:14:15.777 --> 00:14:19.096
Who does she think she's playing...

00:15:07.205 --> 00:15:09.104
Want a drink?

00:15:38.668 --> 00:15:40.552
So,

00:15:41.397 --> 00:15:44.015
that thing you said you needed to discuss,

00:15:44.015 --> 00:15:46.099
what is it?

00:15:51.856 --> 00:15:54.232
I'm going to pry Lee Yang Mi

00:15:55.647 --> 00:15:58.528
off of Son's back.

00:16:04.439 --> 00:16:05.973
Lee Yang Mi's dropped the mask,

00:16:05.973 --> 00:16:09.334
and the cracks between them
are already showing.

00:16:09.334 --> 00:16:11.285
Son already knows that even if he wins,

00:16:11.285 --> 00:16:15.947
he's just going to be Lee Yang Mi's puppet,

00:16:15.947 --> 00:16:18.574
so I'll work on him

00:16:18.574 --> 00:16:22.698
and build a financial cushion
to replace Lee Yang Mi's bankroll

00:16:22.698 --> 00:16:25.097
when the moment's right.

00:16:26.564 --> 00:16:30.667
You're deep inside both Son's
and Lee Yang Mi's circles right now.

00:16:31.521 --> 00:16:35.014
You're willing to risk all that? To do what?

00:16:35.014 --> 00:16:38.725
If I don't move now,
she's going to eat me alive all over again.

00:16:38.725 --> 00:16:41.023
I can't let her ruin

00:16:41.023 --> 00:16:43.448
what I've spent my whole life chasing.

00:16:44.480 --> 00:16:46.478
And you

00:16:46.478 --> 00:16:49.496
can't keep getting stepped on either.

00:16:56.480 --> 00:16:58.672
And I...

00:17:01.188 --> 00:17:03.802
I want you back too.

00:17:13.595 --> 00:17:15.243
After all of it,

00:17:15.243 --> 00:17:18.692
I thought I'd lost you for good.

00:17:20.938 --> 00:17:22.813
But that year without you,

00:17:22.813 --> 00:17:26.522
I realized just how much of you was in me.

00:17:26.522 --> 00:17:29.237
Getting hit, falling down,

00:17:29.237 --> 00:17:32.414
but knowing you were somewhere out there,
looking the same direction...

00:17:33.202 --> 00:17:36.042
that's what kept me standing.

00:17:45.263 --> 00:17:47.137
Yeah...

00:17:48.355 --> 00:17:51.266
I guess we really were alike.

00:17:55.012 --> 00:17:58.732
Sleeping alone, waking up alone in this house,

00:18:00.060 --> 00:18:02.569
I had the exact same thought.

00:18:04.939 --> 00:18:07.957
I was looking too.

00:18:07.957 --> 00:18:10.577
A way to destroy Lee Yang Mi.

00:18:17.886 --> 00:18:20.795
There's someone I need to see first.

00:18:38.472 --> 00:18:40.392
I'm meeting Assemblyman Choi
from the Changjo Party

00:18:40.392 --> 00:18:43.193
and giving him something
he can't walk away from.

00:18:59.786 --> 00:19:04.791
<i>The Doyak Party's mastermind
never picked up my calls,</i>

00:19:04.791 --> 00:19:07.814
<i>and now you come to me. What an honor.</i>

00:19:07.814 --> 00:19:09.928
<i>These are original documents</i>

00:19:10.605 --> 00:19:13.549
<i>containing part of the testimony</i>

00:19:13.549 --> 00:19:16.635
<i>from a key insider in the Daeyang Fund.</i>

00:19:16.635 --> 00:19:19.972
<i>Son doesn't even know this exists,</i>

00:19:19.972 --> 00:19:22.522
<i>so he can't fight it,</i>

00:19:22.522 --> 00:19:26.111
<i>and the impact will be enormous.</i>

00:19:26.745 --> 00:19:29.815
<i>If you'd played this
during last year's election,</i>

00:19:29.815 --> 00:19:32.701
<i>the whole outcome could've been different.</i>

00:19:33.466 --> 00:19:36.972
<i>Why hold it back until now?</i>

00:19:36.972 --> 00:19:38.992
<i>Let's just say I was keeping it
for a day like this.</i>

00:19:38.992 --> 00:19:41.035
<i>I play the long game too.</i>

00:19:41.035 --> 00:19:43.211
<i>That election was never the endgame.</i>

00:19:43.211 --> 00:19:45.714
<i>That takes real nerve.</i>

00:19:46.897 --> 00:19:50.128
<i>Regardless, the files are password-locked.</i>

00:19:50.128 --> 00:19:53.230
<i>Pick the release date with me,</i>

00:19:53.230 --> 00:19:55.724
<i>and I'll send over the password.</i>

00:20:02.318 --> 00:20:05.317
<i>This is Candidate Gu's handwritten pledge.</i>

00:20:08.388 --> 00:20:10.851
[Changjo Party]

00:20:10.851 --> 00:20:13.692
[I'll guarantee Bang Tae Seop the No. 3 PR slot]
<i>Proportional seat number three, it's yours.</i>

00:20:13.692 --> 00:20:15.029
<i>Under the radar,</i>

00:20:15.029 --> 00:20:18.330
<i>but right where the spotlight hits.</i>

00:20:22.244 --> 00:20:24.252
<i>Understood.</i>

00:20:27.023 --> 00:20:29.174
<i>I'll be waiting for your call.</i>

00:20:31.669 --> 00:20:33.480
Once the Changjo Party takes the bait,

00:20:33.480 --> 00:20:36.925
they'll set it off right on cue,

00:20:36.925 --> 00:20:39.643
and when Son's cornered,

00:20:44.057 --> 00:20:48.735
I'll offer to make it go away and cut a deal.

00:20:50.264 --> 00:20:51.814
This is a copy of the USB

00:20:51.814 --> 00:20:54.157
that Hwang Jeong Won left before she died.

00:21:00.713 --> 00:21:02.959
I handed Lee Yang Mi a version

00:21:02.959 --> 00:21:05.953
with the dashcam footage wiped,
the part that proves she's the one

00:21:05.953 --> 00:21:09.039
behind Park Jae Sang's death.

00:21:09.039 --> 00:21:11.750
[Phone records]

00:21:11.750 --> 00:21:13.389
I cleaned it so thoroughly
that even a forensic sweep won't find it.

00:21:13.389 --> 00:21:15.553
She has no reason to doubt it.

00:21:16.173 --> 00:21:18.431
But on this copy,

00:21:19.073 --> 00:21:22.018
that dashcam footage is still there.

00:21:28.564 --> 00:21:30.568
Jeong Won...

00:21:31.539 --> 00:21:34.739
she knew everything.

00:21:44.689 --> 00:21:47.877
I was tired of being a coward.

00:22:15.974 --> 00:22:18.248
This is basically the original
of Oh Kwang Jae's list,

00:22:18.248 --> 00:22:20.744
the one that's gone now.

00:22:25.242 --> 00:22:28.998
[He said he'd introduce me
to the big boss who's funding the drama]

00:22:28.998 --> 00:22:31.546
I started writing everything down
when I was twenty,

00:22:33.269 --> 00:22:36.593
before that bastard ever asked me to.

00:22:39.897 --> 00:22:43.289
I kept going back and forth

00:22:43.289 --> 00:22:46.476
about just blowing it all open,

00:22:46.476 --> 00:22:49.397
or finding a way to take down those men

00:22:50.230 --> 00:22:52.851
and Lee Yang Mi in one shot.

00:22:52.851 --> 00:22:55.706
[I couldn't get away when he grabbed my arm]

00:22:55.706 --> 00:22:59.082
[No, I didn't even try to run.
That's what's so haunting right now]

00:23:07.618 --> 00:23:09.709
Are you sure about this?

00:23:11.981 --> 00:23:14.964
The stakes are high.

00:23:19.564 --> 00:23:22.555
You're putting just as much on the line.

00:23:24.605 --> 00:23:27.477
And I trust we won't fail.

00:23:42.861 --> 00:23:45.597
Then all that's left

00:23:45.597 --> 00:23:48.772
is turning every man in this diary

00:23:48.772 --> 00:23:52.877
into a financial cushion for Son,
to replace Lee Yang Mi's pipeline.

00:24:37.309 --> 00:24:42.183
I saw the article about your son
being named heir to the group.

