but there's nothing on the chart.

00:42:53.719 --> 00:42:56.728
That's malpractice

00:42:57.813 --> 00:43:00.107
and murder by proxy, isn't it?

00:43:04.772 --> 00:43:07.814
- Look, just hear me out.
- You know,

00:43:07.814 --> 00:43:10.048
you might actually end up

00:43:10.048 --> 00:43:13.036
outlasting your pretty stepmother behind bars.

00:43:16.321 --> 00:43:18.314
I thought you were an idiot...

00:43:18.314 --> 00:43:22.295
but you turned the family doctor
and tried to kill your own father.

00:43:24.522 --> 00:43:27.948
What the hell?
This isn't some medieval dynasty.

00:43:27.948 --> 00:43:30.575
All for that WR throne,

00:43:30.575 --> 00:43:33.598
you really outdid yourself. I'll give you that.

00:43:38.647 --> 00:43:40.897
Oh, come on...

00:43:49.276 --> 00:43:51.903
WR's already on your side,

00:43:51.903 --> 00:43:54.320
so why are you pulling this?

00:43:54.320 --> 00:43:57.355
I'm the one who's taking you

00:43:57.355 --> 00:44:02.044
all the way to the Blue House.
So what is your problem?

00:44:03.665 --> 00:44:06.668
Deep down, you know

00:44:06.668 --> 00:44:09.676
how incompetent you are
better than anyone else.

00:44:10.555 --> 00:44:14.681
You'll turn WR into a house of cards.

00:44:15.761 --> 00:44:19.539
I finally have WR under my heel.

00:44:19.539 --> 00:44:20.605
I'm not about to watch it crumble.

00:44:20.605 --> 00:44:23.230
- You piece of shit.
- No.

00:44:23.230 --> 00:44:26.102
That's not it!

00:44:26.102 --> 00:44:28.291
Choose carefully.

00:44:28.291 --> 00:44:30.439
Spend the rest of your life rotting in a cell

00:44:30.439 --> 00:44:33.617
as the man who killed his own father,

00:44:34.355 --> 00:44:37.032
or hold on to whatever's left

00:44:37.032 --> 00:44:39.498
of that empty throne.

00:44:51.064 --> 00:44:53.053
Sir.

00:44:54.355 --> 00:44:58.350
From now on,
every single decision about this Group

00:45:00.147 --> 00:45:03.313
goes through me.

00:45:16.814 --> 00:45:18.703
Petit.

00:45:27.321 --> 00:45:30.590
The real owner of WR

00:45:33.105 --> 00:45:35.345
just changed.

00:45:48.897 --> 00:45:53.056
<i>Standing where I've always dreamed of standing,</i>

00:45:53.056 --> 00:45:56.366
<i>so many faces flood back.</i>

00:45:58.945 --> 00:46:02.038
<i>Oh Kwang Jae, who pushed me into this world</i>

00:46:02.802 --> 00:46:06.042
<i>and plunged straight into hell,</i>

00:46:08.689 --> 00:46:12.257
<i>and the revolting eyes</i>

00:46:13.522 --> 00:46:16.344
<i>of every man who held the power.</i>

00:46:16.962 --> 00:46:20.219
[Four Seasons]

00:46:26.064 --> 00:46:29.560
<i>I'd like to thank the trash reporters</i>

00:46:29.560 --> 00:46:32.439
<i>who used their precious little fingers</i>

00:46:32.439 --> 00:46:35.071
<i>to manufacture my life.</i>

00:46:36.109 --> 00:46:38.909
<i>Thank you.</i>

00:46:50.147 --> 00:46:52.005
<i>And</i>

00:46:53.601 --> 00:46:56.885
<i>to Director Lee Yang Mi,</i>

00:46:57.756 --> 00:47:02.599
<i>who ripped out my beating heart
and left me with nothing but agony,</i>

00:47:04.397 --> 00:47:07.812
<i>my sincerest thanks.</i>

00:47:17.439 --> 00:47:21.201
<i>That we were able to climb this far</i>

00:47:22.382 --> 00:47:25.939
<i>is all thanks to your petty rage</i>

00:47:25.939 --> 00:47:28.750
<i>and your dirty tricks.</i>

00:47:44.355 --> 00:47:46.555
<i>And</i>

00:47:46.555 --> 00:47:51.398
<i>to Bang Tae Seop,
who never threw me away, never let me die,</i>

00:47:52.724 --> 00:47:56.444
<i>even when I was just his shield,
and stood by me all the way here.</i>

00:47:57.158 --> 00:47:59.906
<i>Thank you.</i>

00:48:08.814 --> 00:48:10.959
<i>What were we even bleeding for,</i>

00:48:12.731 --> 00:48:15.964
<i>dragging ourselves,</i>

00:48:18.687 --> 00:48:21.803
<i>all the way here?</i>

00:48:33.897 --> 00:48:36.651
<i>Why did we have to survive</i>

00:48:39.024 --> 00:48:41.656
<i>every single one of those moments?</i>

00:49:49.286 --> 00:49:51.221
Through every one

00:49:51.221 --> 00:49:54.062
of these impossible trials,

00:49:54.749 --> 00:49:59.401
the reason I never gave up
and made it to this stage

00:50:01.772 --> 00:50:04.447
is them.

00:50:05.338 --> 00:50:07.492
I dedicate this honor

00:50:10.522 --> 00:50:13.081
to them.

00:50:17.247 --> 00:50:19.521
Thank you.

00:51:36.647 --> 00:51:39.042
<i>Congratulations.</i>

00:51:42.499 --> 00:51:44.714
<i>Chu Sang Ah.</i>

00:52:24.809 --> 00:52:26.689
Make sure everything stays on track.

00:52:26.689 --> 00:52:28.841
Yes, sir.

00:52:38.472 --> 00:52:40.861
But you know what?

00:52:40.861 --> 00:52:44.357
Aren't you a little too young
to be Senior Secretary for Civil Affairs?

00:52:47.230 --> 00:52:52.129
Well, nobody said
old politics makes for good politics.

00:52:52.129 --> 00:52:54.242
Just like this script right here.

00:53:10.085 --> 00:53:12.652
<i>My fellow citizens,</i>

00:53:12.652 --> 00:53:15.078
<i>and members of the press,</i>

00:53:15.078 --> 00:53:18.971
<i>today marks the 100th day
of our new administration.</i>

00:53:18.971 --> 00:53:23.013
I'm here to reflect
on where we may have fallen short.

00:53:23.013 --> 00:53:26.141
I'm here to reflect
on where we may have fallen short.

00:53:26.141 --> 00:53:28.772
And to recommit ourselves to our mission.

00:53:28.772 --> 00:53:32.401
And to recommit ourselves to our mission.

00:53:32.401 --> 00:53:34.191
One-second pause.

00:53:34.191 --> 00:53:36.109
[Blue House, Republic of Korea]

00:53:36.109 --> 00:53:39.897
45 degrees right.

00:53:39.897 --> 00:53:41.748
And smile.

00:53:43.230 --> 00:53:44.786
First.

00:53:44.786 --> 00:53:48.500
I'd like to express my gratitude to the people.

00:53:48.500 --> 00:53:53.213
<i>Thanks to your unwavering support,</i>

00:53:53.213 --> 00:53:57.347
<i>we've been able to govern without disruption.</i>

00:53:58.938 --> 00:54:01.260
<i>With the Seoam mayoral race just ten days out,</i>

00:54:01.260 --> 00:54:04.179
[Doyak's Bang Tae Seop on the Trail]
<i>former Senior Secretary Bang Tae Seop</i>

00:54:04.179 --> 00:54:06.351
<i>is leading in the polls.</i>

00:54:06.351 --> 00:54:10.060
<i>After spearheading sweeping reforms
of prosecution and law enforcement,</i>

00:54:10.060 --> 00:54:12.604
<i>Candidate Bang's approval has soared,</i>

00:54:12.604 --> 00:54:15.066
<i>and he's not just the frontrunner
for Seoam Mayor,</i>

00:54:15.066 --> 00:54:16.881
[Youth Support Fuels Presidential Buzz]
<i>he's already being talked about</i>

00:54:16.881 --> 00:54:19.278
<i>as a serious contender for the presidency.</i>

00:54:19.278 --> 00:54:20.737
One last question.

00:54:20.737 --> 00:54:23.898
What does Chu Sang Ah mean to you?

00:54:23.898 --> 00:54:26.579
My wife and I have fought through

00:54:26.579 --> 00:54:29.583
countless hardships together.

00:54:29.583 --> 00:54:32.814
For someone who still has a long road ahead,

00:54:32.814 --> 00:54:35.093
she's my one and only ally.

00:54:36.943 --> 00:54:40.932
[Doyak Party, Bang Tae Seop]
We need to head in. Let's wrap it here.

00:54:41.762 --> 00:54:42.856
Thank you.

00:54:42.856 --> 00:54:44.772
Thank you.

00:54:44.772 --> 00:54:48.815
Oh, by the way,
did you hear about the WR family?

00:54:54.045 --> 00:54:55.063
[WR Chairman Kwon Regains Consciousness,
Signaling Return]

00:54:55.063 --> 00:54:58.658
[Second son Kwon Jong Il rumored to return,
replacing Director Lee Yang Mi]

00:54:58.658 --> 00:55:02.230
<i>WR Group Chairman Kwon Se Myeong,
one of Korea's biggest names in business,</i>

00:55:02.230 --> 00:55:05.971
<i>has reportedly woken up
after his long fight with illness.</i>

00:55:05.971 --> 00:55:08.327
<i>There are also reports
that his second son, Kwon Jong Il,</i>

00:55:08.327 --> 00:55:10.932
<i>is stepping back into management,</i>

00:55:10.932 --> 00:55:15.383
<i>and all eyes are
on WR Group's leadership shakeup.</i>

00:55:28.513 --> 00:55:34.475
[Director Lee Yang Mi to be Released
via Special Pardon on the 20th]

00:55:44.908 --> 00:55:48.967
[Caller ID Restricted]

00:55:57.316 --> 00:55:59.416
<i>This is Cheongseong Penitentiary.</i>

00:55:59.416 --> 00:56:02.972
<i>This call may be monitored.</i>

00:56:11.731 --> 00:56:13.941
Chu Sang Ah.

00:56:27.451 --> 00:56:30.023
I'll be seeing you

00:56:30.023 --> 00:56:31.834
very soon.

00:56:54.144 --> 00:56:55.654
[Waiting Room: Chu Sang Ah]

00:57:39.647 --> 00:57:41.900
Sang Ah.

00:57:41.900 --> 00:57:43.897
Sang Ah.

00:57:43.897 --> 00:57:45.658
Sang Ah.

00:58:06.023 --> 00:58:07.972
Sang Ah.

00:58:08.731 --> 00:58:10.641
Sang Ah.

00:58:12.689 --> 00:58:14.023
Sang Ah.

00:58:14.023 --> 00:58:15.855
Sang Ah.

00:58:31.147 --> 00:58:32.690
Sang Ah, stay with me.

00:58:32.690 --> 00:58:35.499
Sang Ah!

00:58:59.174 --> 00:59:01.776
Where am I?

00:59:05.436 --> 00:59:08.195
Are you with me?

00:59:08.195 --> 00:59:10.076
Are you okay?

00:59:14.201 --> 00:59:16.749
Is this hell?

00:59:44.731 --> 00:59:46.737
Yeah...

00:59:48.942 --> 00:59:51.075
It's hell.

01:02:05.035 --> 01:02:08.254
<i>Ladies and gentlemen,
the moment you've been waiting for.</i>

01:02:09.153 --> 01:02:11.644
<i>Please welcome Candidate Bang Tae Seop</i>

01:02:11.644 --> 01:02:14.314
<i>and his lifelong partner,</i>

01:02:14.314 --> 01:02:16.640
<i>actress Chu Sang Ah!</i>

01:04:33.141 --> 01:04:39.081
[To our climax: shattered, but never broken]